                     TODO add runtime ‖J_ψ‖<1 singular-value gate (Cor_NoCompose_2 / P3)."
  adaptive_clock_rs:"projects/vsf-nucleus/src/adaptive_clock.rs — Bound_Staleness sync
                     protocol negates Cor_NoCompose_3."
  trust_axes_rs:    "projects/vsf-nucleus/src/trust_axes.rs — Def_TrustCompose + τ_threshold
                     for Cor_4."
